{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iHjGxP51BR1793483270.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>俄烏雙方在奧列什基實施局部停火，部分居民撤離到烏克蘭。</p><p></p><p>周六有大批民眾在俄羅斯控制的奧列什基，先坐飛機到白俄羅斯，再坐巴士轉抵烏克蘭切爾尼戈夫州。當局向他們分發食品、生活物資及提供醫療服務等，有受訪居民稱在奧列什基不時受到無人機襲擊，市內布滿地雷。</p><p></p><p>奧列什基位於第聶伯河東岸，據報約有2,000名居民，大多是行動不便的長者，在美國第一夫人梅拉尼亞斡旋下，俄烏雙方上周二起局部停火，安排居民經安全通道撤離。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.UKR.RUS-0400_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269t2mp8bFYV1793483302.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>烏克蘭總統澤連斯基到訪伊斯坦布爾，會晤土耳其總統埃爾多安，討論雙邊關係、黑海航運等議題。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:07.834567+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":247,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T21:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.774741+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:07.093730+00:00","content_hash":"c56802be6ed19477e053e1bd1b36ee036c8d688d9903d8783cb3ca5a0455586b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:07.834567+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}